    Fix tag operation by adding missing callback (#7753)
    
    This PR fixes https://github.com/opencast/opencast/issues/7702 by adding
    a missing OSGi callback method.
    
    ### How to test this patch
    
    Use OC version 19.5 or higher and try to run a workflow which uses a tag
    operation with the configuration option `copy: true` . If the operation
    works without issues and creates the copy, this patch works as intended.
    
